    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tī^grānes</span></b> , is,
			m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A king of Armenia</i>, <i>son-in-law
				of Mithridates</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Imp. Pomp. 9, 23</span></i>; <i><span class="en">15,
			45</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Sest. 27, 58</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Att. 2,
				4, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sall. H. 4, 61, 3</span></i> Dietsch; <i><span class="en">Flor. 3, 5,
				27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 12,
			43</span></i>. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>His son</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Att. 3,
				8, 3</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Ascon. Cic. Mil. p. 47</span></i> Orell.; Schol.
			Bob. <i><span class="en">Cic. Mil. p. 284</span></i> ib.</div>
